# Per-task data/working folders that may exist across branches
# NOTE (FM-PCC vendor): the upstream `d3il/`, `datasets/`, `dataset/`, `experiment/`
# ignores were REMOVED here on purpose. HardFlow is vendored into FM-PCC as plain
# copied code, so the d3il simulator + avoiding demos (~61MB) MUST be tracked by
# FM-PCC's git to reach the cluster via `git pull`. Re-adding them would hide the sim.
